139:   **Small sizes:** 9–11px text tokens are never used in apps. 12px only for L4 fine print and labels nobody acts on. A status tag is 14 (`.tm-tag--md`) [RECOMMENDED 2026-11-25, D-111]. Anything the user needs to act on (clinical details, amounts, status, errors) is 14px or larger.
286:### 9.3 Lists, tags and cards
287:- **Rows:** thumb · title · meta · trailing. A **chevron** only when the row opens something. **Row with a status:** title on line 1 (full width); line 2 = one short fact on the left (14/20 semibold, e.g. "Qty 30") and the status tag on the right (`.tm-row__line`, D-54). Details that belong to an edit screen (dose, duration) are not repeated in the row. **Read-only rows** (e.g. a closed task): muted text, no chevron, not tappable, still readable.
288:- **Status tags:** colour by meaning — done = success, needs action = warning, removed / inactive = neutral, failed = critical. **Reserve the tag width** so the row text never re-wraps when the status changes. Tag text meets AA.
ui-screens/app-logic.md:87:- **Profile page** (D-70: a page, not a sheet — task header with Back, no logo; content ported from the current app with design-system fixes, D-69; full redesign later): doctor name and role · prescriptions written today (D-111) · today's earnings (earned, incentive) · User manual · **Faster sign-in on/off** · **Log out** (destructive). During an open case Log out is replaced by "You can log out after this case is closed." Log out is the last item in the content (not pinned). Cards are 16 apart and Log out is 32 below the last card (D-111; was 16, A-13). The group label "Today's earnings" is 16 semibold, like the other group labels (A-20). Log out asks first in a **sheet**: "Log out? — You'll stop getting cases until you sign in again." · Log out · Stay signed in.
